Package: RobotNavUncertainty
Title: Statistical Evaluation of Robot Navigation Algorithms Under Uncertainty
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-10-19
Authors@R: person("Researcher", "Name", email="researcher@example.com", role=c("aut","cre"))
Description: A simulation-based statistical research framework comparing
    Dijkstra, A*, and Risk-Aware path planning under configurable environmental
    uncertainty. Includes Monte Carlo experiments, hypothesis testing, and an
    interactive Shiny dashboard.
